{"product_id":"wow-animal","title":"Wow! Animal","description":"\u003cp\u003eThis title features everything you want to know, see and find out about animals. It is a visually amazing encyclopedia all about animals. It is crammed full of incredible stuff to dip into, from cool crustaceans to amazing arachnids, all revealed in a fascinating, exciting, totally different way: it's like a natural history museum, a search engine and the world's biggest zoo all rolled into one. It includes loads of animal-related topics, hundreds of pictures, thousands of words and squillions of amazing things to discover and explore. So find it. See it. Know it.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 256 x 308\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Richard Walker\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781405341585\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Hardcover\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 128\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45675036475545,"sku":"BLK-49781405341585","price":20.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68a9f1ff6e6cf_Wow__Animal_Richard_Walker.jpg?v=1756279641","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/wow-animal","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}